        <mxCell id="note" value="Solid = request/data path · Dashed = auth / control path.&#xa;ALB: 403 without the CloudFront origin-verify header; security group admits CloudFront edge nodes only. Every /api/* call requires a Cognito JWT (write APIs: admin role).&#xa;Pull is the primary path: connectors read AgentCore, Guardrails and CloudWatch with the read-only task role. Push (Lambda translator) is optional, for near-real-time runs.&#xa;Cross-account spokes (not drawn): the task role assumes agent-lineage-readonly in each spoke account, guarded by a per-deployment ExternalId." style="text;html=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#5A6C86;align=left;whiteSpace=wrap;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="300" y="950" width="720" height="115" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
